render: when a VarDCT frame's modular image uses palette or squeeze (and is decoded whole), size the
modular region to the block-aligned frame, as a full-frame render does; compute_modular_region could
return a size that is not whole blocks, and appending the modular channels to the frame buffer hit
assert_eq!(buffer.width(), width) (image.rs). Test: vardct_modular_region_block_aligned
(crates/jxl-oxide-tests/tests/vardct_modular_region_block_aligned.rs).

Upstream: not reported; the code is unchanged at upstream HEAD (c0cc4c7, 2026-08-15).

